{
  "slug": "mine",
  "name": "Mine",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Mines every Claude Code session into a local SQLite database and provides a /mine skill with 18+ natural language query intents. Track costs, tokens, tools, projects, errors, cache efficiency, and full-text search across all your past conversations. Features automatic session ingestion via hooks, error memory that warns when you repeat mistakes, cost anomaly detection, project/global scope detection, and API value tracking with subscription ROI comparisons. Zero external dependencies (stdlib Python only)",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 command** and **5 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `help` (all /mine intents, examples, and setup)\n- **Commands** (1): `mine` (your usage data — sessions, costs, search, and patterns)\n- **Hooks** (5): `SessionEnd`, `SubagentStop`, `PreCompact`, `SessionStart`, `PostToolUseFailure`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install mine@claude-community` from `anipotts/claude-code-tips` (`plugins/mine`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 1,
    "hook": 5,
    "command": 1
  },
